124
00:02:14,190 --> 00:02:15,340
Bu mistik olmuş!

125
00:02:15,700 --> 00:02:17,120
Sen gökyüzündeki

126
00:02:17,120 --> 00:02:18,120
Tanrı'yı yıktın

127
00:02:18,120 --> 00:02:19,580
